{"id":"u-a7056799-e9e6-45d5-ac14-58d13eb0fd97","src":"community","title":"Upper Lower Split","author":"Kristen H.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/JrKzyu-untitled-program","desc":"This 4-day hypertrophy program is designed to prioritize glute and triceps growth while building strong, balanced legs and a defined upper body. Two lower-body days emphasize the glutes, quads, and hamstrings through movements such as hip thrusts, squats, Romanian deadlifts, lunges, and abduction work. Two upper-body days place extra focus on the triceps while also training the shoulders, back, chest, and biceps.\n\nCore work is included throughout the week, with an emphasis on progressive overload to help build muscle, improve strength, and create a more sculpted physique.\n\nThis program is ideal for beginner-to-intermediate lifters who have access to a commercial gym and want a lower-body-focused routine without neglecting the upper body. Run the program for 8 weeks, aiming to gradually increase reps, weight, or training quality while maintaining proper form.\n\nPrimary focus: Glutes + Triceps\nSecondary focus: Quads, Hamstrings + Abs\nAdditional focus: Back, Shoulders, Chest + Biceps","level":["Beginner","Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Women's","Strength","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":8,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-10-29T21:06:35.027Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper body","Lower body","Upper body","Lower body"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Arnold Press","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":20,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hip Thrust (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":4}]},{"n"